#. TRANSLATORS: the setup wizard's own buttons, headings and labels.
#. Keep button labels short; they sit in fixed-width buttons beside
#. each other. %1 and %2 are values substituted at runtime and may be
#. reordered to suit the language.
#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:16
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:70
msgid "Set Up Dagric"
msgstr "Configurer Dagric"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:17
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:916
msgid "Every step can be skipped, and you can change all of it later."
msgstr "Chaque étape peut être ignorée, et tout est modifiable plus tard."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:18
msgid "I'll do this later"
msgstr "Je ferai cela plus tard"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:19
msgid ""
"Close setup. Anything already applied stays, and you can run this again from "
"the Dagric Hub"
msgstr ""
"Fermez la configuration. Ce qui est déjà appliqué reste en place, et vous "
"pouvez la relancer depuis le Dagric Hub"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:20
msgid "Undo my changes"
msgstr "Annuler mes modifications"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:21
msgid ""
"Put the colours, wallpaper, text size and taskbar back the way they were "
"when setup opened"
msgstr ""
"Remettez les couleurs, le fond d'écran, la taille du texte et la barre des "
"tâches tels qu'ils étaient à l'ouverture de la configuration"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:22
msgid "PRO EDITION"
msgstr "ÉDITION PRO"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:23
msgid "Pro edition"
msgstr "Édition Pro"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:24
msgid "Live trial — anything you set here lasts until you shut down."
msgstr "Essai live — tout ce que vous réglez ici dure jusqu'à l'extinction."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:25
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Retour"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:26
msgid "Go back to the previous step"
msgstr "Revenir à l'étape précédente"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:27
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Suivant"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:28
msgid "Go to the next step"
msgstr "Aller à l'étape suivante"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:29
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Terminer"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:30
msgid "Close setup and start using Dagric"
msgstr "Fermer la configuration et commencer à utiliser Dagric"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:31
msgid "Skip this step"
msgstr "Passer cette étape"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:32
msgid "Leave this setting alone and go to the next step"
msgstr "Laisser ce réglage tel quel et passer à l'étape suivante"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:33
msgid "Let's go"
msgstr "C'est parti"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:34
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Bienvenue"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:35
msgid "How it looks"
msgstr "Apparence"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:36
msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Taille du texte"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:37
msgid "The taskbar"
msgstr "Barre des tâches"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:38
msgid "Your files"
msgstr "Vos fichiers"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:39
msgid "You're ready"
msgstr "Tout est prêt"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:40
msgid "Step %1"
msgstr "Étape %1"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:41
msgid "Step %1 of %2"
msgstr "Étape %1 sur %2"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:42
msgid "current step"
msgstr "étape actuelle"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:43
msgid "done"
msgstr "terminée"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:44
msgid "not done yet"
msgstr "pas encore faite"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:45
msgid "Welcome to %1."
msgstr "Bienvenue dans %1."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:46
msgid ""
"Let's make it yours. A few minutes now — the colours, the wallpaper, how big "
"the text is, where the taskbar sits, and your files from Windows — and then "
"it's out of your way."
msgstr ""
"Faisons-en le vôtre. Quelques minutes maintenant — les couleurs, le fond "
"d'écran, la taille du texte, la place de la barre des tâches et vos fichiers "
"depuis Windows — et ensuite on vous laisse tranquille."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:47
msgid ""
"Let's make it yours. A few minutes now — the colours, the wallpaper, how big "
"the text is, where the taskbar sits — and then it's out of your way."
msgstr ""
"Faisons-en le vôtre. Quelques minutes maintenant — les couleurs, le fond "
"d'écran, la taille du texte, la place de la barre des tâches — et ensuite on "
"vous laisse tranquille."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:48
msgid "Pick a look."
msgstr "Choisissez un style."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:49
msgid "Click anything — the desktop behind this window changes as you go."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur ce que vous voulez — le bureau derrière cette fenêtre change au "
"fur et à mesure."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:50
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Thème"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:51
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:930
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Clair"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:52
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:930
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Sombre"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:53
msgid "Light theme"
msgstr "Thème clair"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:54
msgid "A bright desktop. Shows a small picture of what it looks like."
msgstr "Un bureau clair. Montre une petite image de ce que ça donne."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:55
msgid "Dark theme"
msgstr "Thème sombre"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:56
msgid "A dark desktop, easier on the eyes at night."
msgstr "Un bureau sombre, plus reposant pour les yeux le soir."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:57
msgid "Light theme applied."
msgstr "Thème clair appliqué."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:58
msgid "Dark theme applied."
msgstr "Thème sombre appliqué."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:59
msgid "Highlight colour"
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:60
msgid "%1 highlight colour applied."
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation %1 appliquée."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:61
msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "Fond d'écran"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:62
msgid "Wallpaper %1 of %2"
msgstr "Fond d'écran %1 sur %2"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:63
msgid "Arrow keys to move between wallpapers, Space to apply one"
msgstr ""
"Flèches pour passer d'un fond d'écran à l'autre, Espace pour en appliquer un"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:64
msgid "%1 wallpaper applied."
msgstr "Fond d'écran %1 appliqué."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:65
msgid ""
"Want your own picture? Right-click the desktop and choose Configure Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Vous préférez votre propre image ? Faites un clic droit sur le bureau et "
"choisissez « Configurer le bureau »."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:66
msgid "Is the text the right size?"
msgstr "La taille du texte vous convient ?"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:67
msgid "Dagric guessed from your screen. Pick another size if it guessed wrong."
msgstr ""
"Dagric a deviné d'après votre écran. Choisissez une autre taille s'il s'est "
"trompé."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:68
msgid ""
"Dagric guessed from your screen. A change here takes effect the next time "
"you sign in."
msgstr ""
"Dagric a deviné d'après votre écran. Une modification ici prend effet à la "
"prochaine connexion."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:69
msgid ""
"Dagric guessed from your screen. Pick another size and it changes right away."
msgstr ""
"Dagric a deviné d'après votre écran. Choisissez une autre taille et le "
"changement est immédiat."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:70
msgid "Choose a text size"
msgstr "Choisir une taille de texte"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:71
msgid ""
"Opens a list of text sizes in a separate window. A new size is tried for "
"twenty seconds and put back on its own unless you keep it."
msgstr ""
"Ouvre une liste de tailles de texte dans une fenêtre séparée. Une nouvelle "
"taille est essayée pendant vingt secondes puis revient à la précédente "
"automatiquement, sauf si vous la gardez."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:72
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normale"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:73
msgid "Standard size"
msgstr "Taille standard"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:74
msgid "Bigger"
msgstr "Plus grand"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:75
msgid "Easier to read"
msgstr "Plus facile à lire"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:76
msgid "Biggest"
msgstr "Très grand"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:77
msgid "Large text"
msgstr "Grand texte"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:78
msgid "%1, %2 percent"
msgstr "%1, %2 pour cent"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:79
msgid "Text size set to %1 percent."
msgstr "Taille du texte réglée sur %1 pour cent."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:80
msgid "You can change this again in System Settings ▸ Display & Monitor."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez le modifier à tout moment dans Configuration du système ▸ "
"Affichage et écran."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:81
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:969
msgid "Where should the taskbar go?"
msgstr "Où placer la barre des tâches ?"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:82
msgid ""
"Click one to try it. Your open windows and apps stay exactly where they are."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez-en une pour l'essayer. Vos fenêtres et applications ouvertes ne "
"bougent pas."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:83
msgid "Taskbar layout"
msgstr "Disposition de la barre des tâches"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:84
msgid "Arrow keys to move between layouts, Space to try one"
msgstr ""
"Flèches pour passer d'une disposition à l'autre, Espace pour en essayer une"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:85
msgid "%1 taskbar applied."
msgstr "Barre des tâches %1 appliquée."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:86
msgid "Bring your files across."
msgstr "Récupérez vos fichiers."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:87
msgid ""
"There's a Windows drive in this PC. Dagric can copy your Documents, "
"Pictures, Music, Videos, Downloads and browser bookmarks over."
msgstr ""
"Ce PC contient un disque Windows. Dagric peut copier vos Documents, Images, "
"Musique, Vidéos, Téléchargements et favoris de navigateur depuis ce disque."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:88
msgid "Windows is only ever READ."
msgstr "Windows est uniquement LU."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:89
msgid "Windows is only ever read."
msgstr "Windows est uniquement lu."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:90
msgid ""
"Nothing on the Windows drive is moved, changed or deleted, and files already "
"here are never overwritten. If you change your mind about Dagric, Windows is "
"exactly as you left it."
msgstr ""
"Rien n'est déplacé, modifié ni supprimé sur le disque Windows, et les "
"fichiers déjà présents ici ne sont jamais écrasés. Si vous changez d'avis au "
"sujet de Dagric, Windows est exactement tel que vous l'avez laissé."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:91
msgid "Bring my files over"
msgstr "Transférer mes fichiers"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:92
msgid ""
"Opens the migration tool in its own window. Nothing on the Windows drive is "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Ouvre l'assistant de migration dans sa propre fenêtre. Rien n'est modifié "
"sur le disque Windows."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:93
msgid "This opens in its own window — carry on here while it works."
msgstr ""
"Cela s'ouvre dans une fenêtre séparée — continuez ici pendant que ça "
"travaille."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:94
msgid ""
"Not now? It's in the Dagric Hub under \"Migrate from Windows\", any time."
msgstr ""
"Pas maintenant ? C'est dans le Dagric Hub sous « Migrer depuis Windows », à "
"tout moment."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:95
msgid "That's it — %1 is yours."
msgstr "C'est tout — %1 est à vous."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:96
msgid ""
"Four places worth knowing about. Everything else you can find by pressing "
"the launcher and typing."
msgstr ""
"Quatre endroits à connaître. Tout le reste se trouve en ouvrant le menu et "
"en tapant."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:97
msgid "Dagric Hub"
msgstr "Dagric Hub"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:98
msgid "Drivers, setup, security and migration, all in one menu."
msgstr "Pilotes, configuration, sécurité et migration, dans un seul menu."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:99
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "Guide de l'utilisateur"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:100
msgid "Your first week: updates, printers, Wi-Fi, shortcuts."
msgstr "Votre première semaine : mises à jour, imprimantes, Wi-Fi, raccourcis."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:101
msgid "App Manual"
msgstr "Manuel des applications"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:102
msgid "A page on every app, and what it replaced on Windows."
msgstr "Une page par application, et ce qu'elle remplace sous Windows."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:103
msgid "Welcome page"
msgstr "Page de bienvenue"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:104
msgid "What Dagric is, and the promises it makes."
msgstr "Ce qu’est Dagric, et les promesses qu’il fait."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:105
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Ouvrir"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:106
msgid "Open %1"
msgstr "Ouvrir %1"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:107
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:758
msgid "Your desktop is back the way it was."
msgstr "Votre bureau est revenu à son état précédent."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:108
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:918
msgid ""
"You're running the live trial from the USB stick, so anything you set here "
"lasts until you shut down. Install Dagric first if you want it to stick."
msgstr ""
"Vous utilisez l'essai live depuis la clé USB : tout ce que vous réglez ici "
"dure jusqu'à l'extinction. Installez d'abord Dagric si vous voulez que cela "
"reste."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:109
msgid ""
"This is the live trial. To keep any of it, run Install Dagric OS from the "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes dans l'essai live. Pour conserver quoi que ce soit, lancez "
"« Installer Dagric OS » depuis le bureau."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:110
msgid ""
"Want to run through this again? It's called \"Set Up Dagric\" in your apps "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Vous voulez recommencer ? Cela s'appelle « Configurer Dagric » dans votre "
"liste d'applications."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:111
msgid "Add your apps"
msgstr "Ajoutez vos applications"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:112
msgid ""
"Choose what you want. Each installer opens after Finish and asks before "
"making changes. Some choices are third-party or proprietary; none is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez ce que vous voulez. Chaque programme d’installation s’ouvre après "
"Terminer et demande confirmation avant toute modification. Certaines options "
"sont tierces ou propriétaires ; aucune n’est obligatoire."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:113
msgid "Steam"
msgstr "Steam"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:114
msgid "Optional proprietary Valve client; vendor terms apply."
msgstr ""
"Client Valve propriétaire facultatif ; les conditions du fournisseur "
"s’appliquent."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:115
msgid "Heroic"
msgstr "Heroic"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:116
msgid "Independent launcher for Epic Games Store, GOG and Amazon Games."
msgstr "Lanceur indépendant pour Epic Games Store, GOG et Amazon Games."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:117
msgid "Bottles"
msgstr "Bottles"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:118
msgid "Run Windows programs in separate Wine environments."
msgstr ""
"Exécutez des programmes Windows dans des environnements Wine distincts."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:119
msgid "ONLYOFFICE"
msgstr "ONLYOFFICE"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:120
msgid "An office suite that looks like the one at work."
msgstr "Une suite bureautique qui ressemble à celle du travail."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:121
msgid "Joplin"
msgstr "Joplin"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:122
msgid "Private notes that sync anywhere."
msgstr "Des notes privées qui se synchronisent partout."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:123
msgid "LocalSend"
msgstr "LocalSend"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:124
msgid "Share files between your devices, no cloud."
msgstr "Partagez des fichiers entre vos appareils, sans cloud."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:125
msgid "Cryptomator"
msgstr "Cryptomator"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:126
msgid "Encrypt what you keep in the cloud."
msgstr "Chiffrez ce que vous gardez dans le cloud."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:127
msgid "Upscayl"
msgstr "Upscayl"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:128
msgid "Sharpen old photos with AI."
msgstr "Améliorez vos vieilles photos grâce à l'IA."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:129
msgid "Ollama"
msgstr "Ollama"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:130
msgid "A local AI that never leaves this machine."
msgstr "Une IA locale qui ne quitte jamais cette machine."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:131
msgid "Already bought Pro?"
msgstr "Vous avez déjà acheté Pro ?"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:132
msgid ""
"Paste the code from your receipt and this machine becomes Pro — your files "
"and settings stay."
msgstr ""
"Collez le code de votre reçu et cette machine passe en Pro — vos fichiers et "
"réglages restent en place."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:133
msgid "Selected — starts when you press Finish."
msgstr "Sélectionné — se lance quand vous appuyez sur Terminer."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:134
msgid "Selected"
msgstr "Sélectionné"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:135
msgid ""
"This is the live trial: anything you add now lives in memory, disappears at "
"shutdown, and can make a machine with little RAM unstable. Install Dagric "
"first to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Ceci est l'essai live : tout ce que vous ajoutez maintenant vit en mémoire, "
"disparaît à l'extinction et peut rendre instable une machine avec peu de "
"RAM. Installez d'abord Dagric pour le garder."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:136
msgid ""
"Nothing here is a subscription, and everything can be removed later from the "
"Software Store."
msgstr ""
"Rien ici n'est un abonnement, et tout peut être retiré plus tard depuis la "
"Logithèque."

#. TRANSLATORS: the Family Limits window's own buttons, headings and labels.
#. Keep button labels short; they sit in fixed-width buttons beside
#. each other. %1 and %2 are values substituted at runtime and may be
#. reordered to suit the language.
#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:142
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-family:41
msgid "Family Limits"
msgstr "Limites familiales"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:143
msgid ""
"Set how long someone can use this computer each day, and the hours when it "
"locks itself. Their files and their account are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Définissez combien de temps cet ordinateur peut être utilisé chaque jour, et "
"les heures où il se verrouille tout seul. Les fichiers et le compte de cette "
"personne ne sont pas touchés."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:144
msgid "Person:"
msgstr "Personne :"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:145
msgid "Person to set limits for"
msgstr "Personne à qui appliquer des limites"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:146
msgid ""
"This is the only administrator account on this computer. Limits cannot be "
"set on it, because there would be no way back in. Create a second "
"administrator account first."
msgstr ""
"C'est le seul compte administrateur de cet ordinateur. Aucune limite ne peut "
"lui être appliquée, car il n'y aurait aucun moyen de revenir en arrière. "
"Créez d'abord un deuxième compte administrateur."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:147
msgid ""
"This person has not signed in yet, so there is nothing to change. Ask them "
"to sign in once, then come back."
msgstr ""
"Cette personne ne s'est pas encore connectée, il n'y a donc rien à modifier. "
"Demandez-lui de se connecter une fois, puis revenez ici."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:148
msgid "Limit this person's screen time"
msgstr "Limiter le temps d'écran de cette personne"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:149
msgid "Time allowed each day"
msgstr "Temps autorisé chaque jour"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:150
msgid "Time allowed each day: %1"
msgstr "Temps autorisé chaque jour : %1"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:151
msgid "Bedtime: none — the computer never locks by the clock"
msgstr ""
"Heure du coucher : aucune — l'ordinateur ne se verrouille jamais à heure fixe"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:152
msgid "The computer locks from %1 to %2"
msgstr "L'ordinateur se verrouille de %1 à %2"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:153
msgid "From"
msgstr "De"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:154
msgid "until"
msgstr "à"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:155
msgid "Bedtime starts at"
msgstr "L'heure du coucher commence à"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:156
msgid "Bedtime ends at"
msgstr "L'heure du coucher se termine à"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:157
msgid "Set both to the same hour for no bedtime at all."
msgstr "Mettez les deux à la même heure pour n'avoir aucune heure du coucher."

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:158
msgid "When the time is up:"
msgstr "Quand le temps est écoulé :"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:159
msgid "Lock the screen — nothing is closed, nothing is lost"
msgstr "Verrouiller l'écran — rien n'est fermé, rien n'est perdu"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:160
msgid "Sign out — closes everything that is open"
msgstr "Se déconnecter — ferme tout ce qui est ouvert"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:161
msgid "Remove all limits"
msgstr "Supprimer toutes les limites"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:162
msgid "Lets this person use the computer at any time, for as long as they like"
msgstr ""
"Laisse cette personne utiliser l'ordinateur à tout moment, aussi longtemps "
"qu'elle veut"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:163
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Fermer"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:164
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrer"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:165
msgid "Save these limits for %1"
msgstr "Enregistrer ces limites pour %1"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:166
msgid "%1 minutes"
msgstr "%1 minutes"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:167
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "1 heure"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:168
msgid "%1 hours"
msgstr "%1 heures"

#: po/dagric-data-strings.sh:169
msgid "%1 h %2 min"
msgstr "%1 h %2 min"

