#. TRANSLATORS: "Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed"
#. is the product's central promise, said to somebody who is afraid of
#. losing the Windows install they may still need. Keep the negation and
#. keep the emphasis on READ.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:982
msgid ""
"A Windows drive was found on this PC.\n"
"\n"
"Bring your Documents, Pictures, Music, Videos and browser bookmarks\n"
"across now? Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed."
msgstr ""
"Un disque Windows a été trouvé sur ce PC.\n"
"\n"
"Récupérer maintenant vos Documents, Images, Musique, Vidéos et vos favoris "
"du\n"
"navigateur ? Windows est uniquement LU — rien n'y est modifié."

#. TRANSLATORS: "Dagric Hub", "Dagric Manual" and "Set Up Dagric" are the
#. names the owner has to TYPE into the launcher to find these things, so
#. they must match the Name= of dagric-hub.desktop, dagric-manual.desktop
#. and dagric-firstrun.desktop in your language, exactly. "Dagric Hub" is
#. not translated at all — it is a product name.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:996
msgid ""
"You're set up.\n"
"\n"
"Everything else lives in the Dagric Hub — press the launcher and type\n"
"\"Dagric Hub\". The offline User Guide is in there, and so is the\n"
"Dagric Manual: a page on every app on this computer and what it\n"
"replaced on Windows.\n"
"\n"
"To see this again, open \"Set Up Dagric\" from the launcher."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes prêt.\n"
"\n"
"Tout le reste se trouve dans le Dagric Hub — ouvrez le menu et tapez\n"
"« Dagric Hub ». Le guide de l'utilisateur hors ligne s'y trouve, ainsi que "
"le\n"
"Manuel Dagric : une page par application de cet ordinateur et ce qu'elle "
"remplace\n"
"sous Windows.\n"
"\n"
"Pour revoir ceci, ouvrez « Configurer Dagric » depuis le menu."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:1365
