msgid "Install did not complete. Check your network and try again."
msgstr ""
"L'installation ne s'est pas terminée. Vérifiez votre connexion réseau et "
"réessayez."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Cryptomator (encrypt before the cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator creates encrypted vaults that live inside your normal cloud\n"
"folders. Your files are encrypted on your machine first, so Google, "
"Dropbox,\n"
"or anyone else only ever stores scrambled data. You hold the only key.\n"
"From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Cryptomator (chiffrer avant le cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator crée des coffres chiffrés qui vivent à l'intérieur de vos "
"dossiers cloud\n"
"habituels. Vos fichiers sont d'abord chiffrés sur votre machine, si bien que "
"Google,\n"
"Dropbox ou n'importe qui d'autre ne stocke jamais que des données "
"brouillées. Vous\n"
"détenez la seule clé.\n"
"Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:19
msgid "Install Cryptomator now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Cryptomator maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:29
msgid "Cryptomator installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Cryptomator est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic is an independent, open-source launcher supporting Epic Games Store,\n"
"GOG and Amazon Games accounts. It supports Wine and Proton for compatible\n"
"Windows titles and installs from Flathub.\n"
"\n"
"Heroic is not official or endorsed by those providers. Compatibility "
"varies,\n"
"and provider, game and optional runtime terms still apply."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic est un lanceur indépendant et open-source prenant en charge les "
"comptes Epic Games Store, GOG et Amazon Games. Il prend en charge Wine et "
"Proton pour les titres Windows compatibles et s'installe depuis Flathub.\n"
"\n"
"Heroic n'est ni officiel ni approuvé par ces fournisseurs. La compatibilité "
"varie, et les conditions des fournisseurs, des jeux et des environnements "
"d'exécution optionnels s'appliquent toujours."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:21
msgid "Install Heroic now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Heroic maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:31
msgid "Heroic installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Heroic est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Joplin (notes that stay yours)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin keeps notes, notebooks, and to-dos in plain Markdown on YOUR disk.\n"
"No account required, works fully offline, and if you ever want sync it's\n"
"end-to-end encrypted — to a folder, Syncthing, or your own server.\n"
"The private alternative to OneNote and Notion. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Joplin (des notes qui restent les vôtres)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin garde vos notes, carnets et tâches en Markdown simple sur VOTRE "
"disque.\n"
"Aucun compte requis, fonctionne entièrement hors ligne, et si un jour vous "
"voulez\n"
"la synchronisation, elle est chiffrée de bout en bout — vers un dossier, "
"Syncthing\n"
"ou votre propre serveur.\n"
"L'alternative privée à OneNote et Notion. Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:19
msgid "Install Joplin now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Joplin maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:29
msgid "Joplin installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Joplin est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install LocalSend (share files, privately)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend sends files and messages straight between your devices on the "
"same\n"
"network — phone, laptop, desktop — with no account, no cloud, and nothing\n"
"leaving your network. It's the private alternative to AirDrop. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer LocalSend (partager des fichiers, en privé)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend envoie fichiers et messages directement entre vos appareils sur le "
"même\n"
"réseau — téléphone, portable, ordinateur de bureau — sans compte, sans "
"cloud, et\n"
"rien ne sort de votre réseau. L'alternative privée à AirDrop. Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:18
msgid "Install LocalSend now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer LocalSend maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:29
msgid "LocalSend installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "LocalSend est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:30
msgid "Install it on your phone too (same name) and they'll find each other."
msgstr ""
"Installez-le aussi sur votre téléphone (même nom) et les appareils se "
"trouveront tout seuls."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ONLYOFFICE", "LibreOffice", "Word", "Excel", "PowerPoint" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:13
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ONLYOFFICE (the familiar Office look)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an open-source office suite with the ribbon\n"
"layout Microsoft Office users already know, and excellent compatibility\n"
"with Word/Excel/PowerPoint files. It runs alongside LibreOffice — keep\n"
"whichever feels right (or both). From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer ONLYOFFICE (l'apparence familière d'Office)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors est une suite bureautique libre avec le ruban que "
"les\n"
"utilisateurs de Microsoft Office connaissent déjà, et une excellente "
"compatibilité\n"
"avec les fichiers Word/Excel/PowerPoint. Elle cohabite avec LibreOffice — "
"gardez\n"
"celle qui vous convient (ou les deux). Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:21
msgid "Install ONLYOFFICE now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer ONLYOFFICE maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:31
msgid "ONLYOFFICE installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ONLYOFFICE est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ProtonUp-Qt", "GE-Proton", "Wine-GE", "Steam", "Lutris" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:12
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt is a free, open-source app for installing and switching between\n"
"GE-Proton and Wine-GE versions for Steam and Lutris — no terminal needed.\n"
"It installs from Flathub. Compatibility varies by title and service; GE-"
"Proton\n"
"is an independent project and is not affiliated with Valve's Proton project."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt est une application gratuite et open-source pour installer et "
"basculer entre les versions GE-Proton et Wine-GE pour Steam et Lutris — sans "
"besoin de terminal. Elle s'installe depuis Flathub. La compatibilité varie "
"selon le titre et le service ; GE-Proton est un projet indépendant et n'est "
"pas affilié au projet Proton de Valve."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:20
msgid "Install ProtonUp-Qt now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer ProtonUp-Qt maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:30
msgid "ProtonUp-Qt installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ProtonUp-Qt est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are COMMANDS the owner types verbatim
#. into a terminal — cd, unzip, sudo and the file names must not be translated
#. or reflowed, or the instructions stop working. The last paragraph is a
#. LICENCE statement (Dagric has not obtained redistribution permission and
#. does not bundle Resolve); keep that meaning exact. "DaVinci Resolve",
#. "Blackmagic", "NVIDIA" and "Dagric" are names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-resolve:16
msgid ""
"DaVinci Resolve on Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visit  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (opening it in your browser now if possible...)\n"
"2. Click \"Free Download\", pick the Linux version, and register.\n"
"3. Unzip the download, then run the installer:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. NVIDIA users: run  sudo dagric-drivers  first — Resolve on Linux\n"
"   performs best with the proprietary driver.\n"
"\n"
"Why isn't it preinstalled? Dagric has not obtained permission to "
"redistribute\n"
"Resolve. This helper opens Blackmagic's official download and current terms."
msgstr ""
"DaVinci Resolve sur Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visitez  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (ouverture dans votre navigateur maintenant si possible...)\n"
"2. Cliquez sur « Free Download », choisissez la version Linux, et inscrivez-"
"vous.\n"
"3. Décompressez le téléchargement, puis exécutez l'installateur :\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. Utilisateurs NVIDIA : exécutez  sudo dagric-drivers  d'abord — Resolve "
"sur Linux\n"
"   fonctionne mieux avec le pilote propriétaire.\n"
"\n"
"Pourquoi n'est-il pas préinstallé ? Dagric n'a pas obtenu la permission de "
"redistribuer Resolve. Cet assistant ouvre le téléchargement officiel de "
"Blackmagic et les conditions actuelles."

#. TRANSLATORS: keep the distinction between software included in Dagric and a
#. user-requested download. "Steam" and "Valve" are third-party product names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:16
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam is Valve's proprietary game store and launcher. Dagric does not "
"include\n"
"or redistribute the Steam client. If you choose to continue, Debian's "
"installer\n"
"will obtain it under Valve's terms. Dagric Pro already includes its open-"
"source\n"
"system dependencies.\n"
"\n"
"This also installs Debian's open-source steam-devices access rules for "
"advanced\n"
"controller features and /dev/uinput. Debian warns that these rules trade "
"local-\n"
"user isolation for functionality and should not be used on a machine with\n"
"untrusted local users.\n"
"\n"
"You'll be asked for your administrator password, then Steam downloads and\n"
"installs. Afterwards, launch \"Steam\" from the application launcher."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam est la boutique et le lanceur propriétaires de Valve. Dagric n'inclut "
"ni ne redistribue le client Steam. Si vous choisissez de continuer, "
"l'installateur de Debian l'obtiendra selon les conditions de Valve. Dagric "
"Pro inclut déjà ses dépendances système open source.\n"
"\n"
"Ceci installe également les règles d'accès open source steam-devices de "
"Debian pour les fonctionnalités avancées du contrôleur et /dev/uinput. "
"Debian avertit que ces règles échangent l'isolation des utilisateurs locaux "
"contre la fonctionnalité et ne doivent pas être utilisées sur une machine "
"avec des utilisateurs locaux non fiables.\n"
"\n"
"Votre mot de passe administrateur vous sera demandé, puis Steam se "
"téléchargera et s'installera. Ensuite, lancez « Steam » depuis le lanceur "
"d'applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:34
msgid "Install Steam now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Steam maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:70
msgid ""
"Steam installed. Launch it from the application launcher; on first\n"
"run it finishes updating itself."
msgstr ""
"Steam est installé. Lancez-le depuis le menu des applications ; au premier\n"
"démarrage, il termine sa mise à jour."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:77
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Steam installation did not complete (exit $RC). You can retry from\n"
"the Dagric Hub, or check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"L'installation de Steam ne s'est pas terminée (code de sortie $RC). Vous "
"pouvez\n"
"réessayer depuis le Dagric Hub ou vérifier votre connexion réseau."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Upscayl (AI image upscaler, offline)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl enlarges and sharpens photos and artwork using AI that runs locally "
"on\n"
"your machine — nothing is uploaded. Great for rescuing small or old images.\n"
"A capable GPU helps but isn't required. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Upscayl (agrandissement d'images par IA, hors ligne)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl agrandit et affine photos et illustrations avec une IA qui tourne "
"localement\n"
"sur votre machine — rien n'est envoyé sur Internet. Parfait pour sauver de "
"petites\n"
"ou vieilles images. Une bonne carte graphique aide mais n'est pas "
"indispensable.\n"
"Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:18
msgid "Install Upscayl now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Upscayl maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:28
msgid "Upscayl installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Upscayl est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two bullet points are a PRIVACY disclosure — Variety can
#. fetch wallpapers from third-party websites, and that is why Dagric does not
#. preinstall it. Keep both the fact and the "OFF until you enable it" caveat.
#. "Slideshow" and "Configure Desktop and Wallpaper" are labels the owner has
#. to find in Plasma, so use the wording Plasma itself uses in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:20
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Variety (automatic wallpaper changer)\n"
"\n"
"Variety changes your wallpaper on a schedule, from your own folders and,\n"
"if you switch it on, from online collections. It adds a tray icon for\n"
"skipping, pausing and favouriting the current image.\n"
"\n"
"Two things worth knowing before you install:\n"
"  * Variety can download wallpapers from third-party websites. That is\n"
"    OFF until you enable a source, but it is why Dagric doesn't preinstall "
"it.\n"
"  * If you only want a rotating slideshow of your OWN pictures, you don't\n"
"    need this at all — right-click the desktop, Configure Desktop and\n"
"    Wallpaper, and choose \"Slideshow\".\n"
"\n"
"Installed from the system's own repositories (GPL-3, open source), about 25 "
"MB\n"
"with its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Variety (changement automatique de fond d'écran)\n"
"\n"
"Variety change votre fond d'écran selon un horaire, depuis vos propres "
"dossiers et,\n"
"si vous l'activez, depuis des collections en ligne. Il ajoute une icône dans "
"la\n"
"zone de notification pour passer, mettre en pause ou mettre en favori "
"l'image en cours.\n"
"\n"
"Deux choses à savoir avant de l'installer :\n"
"  * Variety peut télécharger des fonds d'écran depuis des sites tiers. "
"C'est\n"
"    DÉSACTIVÉ tant que vous n'activez pas une source, mais c'est la raison "
"pour\n"
"    laquelle Dagric ne le préinstalle pas.\n"
"  * Si vous voulez seulement un diaporama de VOS propres images, vous n'en "
"avez\n"
"    pas besoin du tout — clic droit sur le bureau, « Configurer le bureau et "
"le\n"
"    fond d'écran », puis choisissez « Diaporama ».\n"
"\n"
"Installé depuis les dépôts du système (GPL-3, logiciel libre), environ 25 Mo "
"avec\n"
"ses dépendances."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:37
msgid "Install Variety now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Variety maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:46
msgid "Variety installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Variety est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:47
msgid "It starts in the system tray; right-click the icon for options."
msgstr ""
"Il démarre dans la zone de notification ; clic droit sur l'icône pour les "
"options."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:61
msgid ""
"To rotate the wallpapers already on this computer, open\n"
"Variety's preferences, go to Images, choose Add and then Folder, and pick:\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/share/wallpapers\n"
"\n"
"That is the thirty-four Dagric packs, and every KDE wallpaper besides. A\n"
"folder source works entirely offline — nothing is downloaded and no website\n"
"is contacted."
msgstr ""
"Pour faire défiler les fonds d'écran déjà présents sur cet ordinateur, "
"ouvrez\n"
"les préférences de Variety, section Images, choisissez Ajouter puis "
"Dossier :\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/share/wallpapers\n"
"\n"
"Ce sont les trente-quatre packs Dagric, et tous les fonds d'écran KDE en "
"plus.\n"
"Une source de type dossier fonctionne entièrement hors ligne — rien n'est\n"
"téléchargé et aucun site web n'est contacté."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:71
msgid "Install did not complete (administrator access is required)."
msgstr ""
"L'installation ne s'est pas terminée (un accès administrateur est "
"nécessaire)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:72
msgid "You can try again from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Vous pouvez réessayer depuis le Dagric Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-guide:23
msgid "The Dagric user guide is not installed."
msgstr "Le guide de l'utilisateur Dagric n'est pas installé."

